# DeviceMaster Configuration File
# This file stores device customizations and rules
#
# NOTE: no section is shipped on purpose.
#
#   * device / group / schedule sections are created on demand by the plugin.
#     Shipping empty template stanzas here produced a blank card in the device
#     list and empty rows in 分组配置 (an empty `option mac ''` is a present but
#     empty string, which uci:foreach() hands to Lua as "" - and "" is truthy).
#
#   * the old `config global` stanza (enabled / auto_detect / oui_lookup /
#     traffic_monitor / refresh_interval / history_days) was removed because NO
#     code in the project ever read it: the switches did nothing. Anything that
#     needs a default lives in the section that actually consumes it:
#       - OUI switches  -> the named 'settings' section (created by
#                          /usr/libexec/devicemaster/uci_init.sh, edited by the
#                          OUI管理 page, read by luci-app-devicemaster)
#       - grouping      -> the named group sections created by uci_init.sh
#
# Never ship an anonymous *empty* section either: it would be picked up as a
# real (but blank) device/group row.
